STEP 0: _____________ 00_simulate_spectra.py ________________
it gives 1000 batch files with N_SIM spectra each (based on mask_db input given to pamtra)
Read radar_config.json
Run it: python3 00_simulate_spectra.py 0 1000   -> it gives 1000 batch files with N_SIM spectra each


STEP 1: _____________ 01_convert_to_h5.py batch0_0 __________
Will concatenate all the individual files generated by 00_simulate_spectra.py in one big hdf5 file
Run it: python 01_convert_to_h5.py batch0_0


STEP 2: _____________ 02_merge_h5.py __________
Just some file format conversion from hdf5 to f5 (don't know why it is useful)
Run it: python 02_merge_h5.py batch0_0


STEP 3: _____________ 03_merge_h5.py _____________
Add turbulent broadening to the spectra (turb and wind effect)
Run it: python 03_merge_h5.py batch0_0


STEP 4: _____________ 04_prepare_train_set.py _____________ 
reduces size of spectra to 256 velocity bins and some other stuff
shifts the spectra with randomly sampled radial wind values
Run it: python 04_prepare_train_set.py batch0_0

for next steps see direct_retrieval/README  
